WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.300
A costed, buildable design from one paragraph.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.605
Send a paragraph. In a few days, get six parts in one live Excel workbook.

3
00:00:12.905 --> 00:00:24.374
A buildable design, a costed bill of materials, true cost and a financial model, engineering drawings, worked calculations, and a risk and regulatory register.

4
00:00:25.674 --> 00:00:32.981
Every number is a traceable formula, so you, your engineers or an investor can check it and change it.

5
00:00:33.431 --> 00:00:39.807
Not locked to the first answer. Change an assumption and the live workbook recalculates.

6
00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:54.169
Examples include PyBaMM for batteries, CoolProp for fluid properties, PandaPower for power networks and IAPWS-IF97 for steam and water.

7
00:00:55.469 --> 00:01:04.231
Not a guarantee, and not a substitute for your own engineers' sign-off. It is a rigorous first pass, made to be checked.

8
00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:10.688
Design Dossier. £2,500, fixed price.

